{"id":"bazi.foundation.wang_shuai_root_transparent","name_zh":"旺衰 / 得令 / 通根 / 透干","domain":"bazi","category":"foundation","summary":"判断日主与十神力量的基础素材，不直接等同于吉凶。","definition":"以月令、季节、天干透出、地支藏干、根气和生克关系综合观察五行与十神的实际力量。V50 中应作为 Structure Profile 的基础层。","conditions":["月令提供季节权重","天干透出使十神可见","地支藏干与本气/中气/余气形成根气","同类与生扶增加可用力量"],"counter_conditions":["仅见一个天干而无根不宜过度判断","被冲合刑害破坏时需降权","调候缺失时不能只看数量"],"related_concepts":["调候","体用","做功流通"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","relationship","health"],"schools":["子平","扶抑派","格局派"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"旺衰在不同流派中权重差异较大，盲派和格局派不一定以扶抑为唯一中心。","sources":[{"title":"Four Pillars of Destiny","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four_Pillars_of_Destiny","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"Heavenly Stems","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heavenly_Stems","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"Earthly Branches","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earthly_Branches","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"partial","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前 V50 有粗略 strength/root，但缺得令、透干、通根细分权重。"}
{"id":"bazi.relation.chong_he_xing_hai_po","name_zh":"合冲刑害破","domain":"bazi","category":"foundation","summary":"地支关系用于判断结构变化、触发、破坏和牵引。","definition":"合、冲、刑、害、破是地支之间的关系素材，应进入 Relation Profile，并影响原局、大运、流年触发。","conditions":["地支之间存在六合、六冲、刑害破关系","被大运或流年引动时影响增强","关系涉及关键十神或宫位时优先级提高"],"counter_conditions":["只见关系不等于事件发生","合化是否成立需看季节、透干和力量","冲不必然为凶，需看冲开还是冲坏"],"related_concepts":["冲合引动","大运流年","三合三会六合"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","relationship","risk"],"schools":["子平","盲派","格局派"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"合化成立条件、刑害破的具体权重在不同流派有差异。","sources":[{"title":"Earthly Branches","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earthly_Branches","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"Sexagenary cycle","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sexagenary_cycle","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"partial","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前只覆盖六冲/六合基线，刑害破未进入 Runtime。"}
{"id":"bazi.relation.sanhe_sanhui_liuhe","name_zh":"三合 / 三会 / 六合","domain":"bazi","category":"foundation","summary":"局势形成的重要结构素材，影响五行气势与做功路径。","definition":"三合、三会、六合属于地支组合关系，常用于判断局势成形、五行偏向和大运流年触发。","conditions":["完整组合出现或被运年补齐","成局五行与月令、透干相呼应","组合影响关键十神或主题"],"counter_conditions":["缺一字或被冲破时只能部分成立","成局不等于吉凶，需看为喜为忌与做功方向"],"related_concepts":["合冲刑害破","做功流通","大运流年"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","timing"],"schools":["子平","格局派"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"半合、拱合、暗合等是否采用需按版本控制。","sources":[{"title":"Earthly Branches","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earthly_Branches","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"partial","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"六合有基线，三合三会缺失。"}
{"id":"bazi.timing.luck_year_activation","name_zh":"大运介入 / 流年触发","domain":"bazi","category":"timing","summary":"大运与流年用于判断结构何时被引动。","definition":"原局表示结构，大运表示阶段气候，流年表示年度触发。三者叠加后才可进入 TimingResult。","conditions":["大运或流年出现关键十神","运年冲合原局关键支","运年补足三合三会或触发墓库","运年改变用神或做功路径"],"counter_conditions":["不能仅凭流年单字断事件","原局没有承接点时触发应降权","现实 Twin 反馈冲突时需 Probe"],"related_concepts":["冲合引动","运年叠加","阶段主题变化"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","relationship","timing"],"schools":["子平","盲派"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"大运与流年的优先级、应期精度和事件映射存在流派差异。","sources":[{"title":"Four Pillars of Destiny","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four_Pillars_of_Destiny","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"missing","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前 V50 Bazi handoff 没有大运流年层，这是 wealth/career 阶段判断的主要缺口。"}
{"id":"bazi.storage.mu_ku","name_zh":"墓库","domain":"bazi","category":"foundation","summary":"墓库是藏、收、蓄、闭、开库类判断的基础。","definition":"墓库涉及辰戌丑未等地支对五行和十神的收纳状态，在财富、资源、资产、关系闭合与开启中常被使用。","conditions":["财官印食等关键十神入库","大运流年冲开或合闭墓库","库中藏干与原局透干形成联系"],"counter_conditions":["墓库不是简单有财或无财","无钥匙、无引动时不宜输出强事件判断","库被刑冲破坏需重新评估"],"related_concepts":["财星入库","冲合引动","大运流年"],"topic_mapping":["wealth","career","family","risk"],"schools":["子平","盲派"],"consensus_level":"medium","controversy":"开库、闭库、墓与库的区别，不同门派解释差异较大。","sources":[{"title":"Earthly Branches","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earthly_Branches","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"missing","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"财星入库必须先补墓库素材。"}
{"id":"bazi.mechanism.output_to_wealth","name_zh":"食伤生财","domain":"bazi","category":"mechanism","summary":"输出、技能、表达、产品进入财富承接。","definition":"食伤代表输出、表达、技术、作品，财代表资源和收益；当食伤能够生财且财有承接时，形成输出变现路径。","conditions":["食伤与财同时出现并有流通","日主有足够输出能力","财星可见或有根","现实收入来源可被 Twin 验证"],"counter_conditions":["财弱无承接则输出难变现","比劫夺财会稀释结果","食伤过旺而无财可能只表达不变现"],"related_concepts":["比劫夺财","身旺财弱","做功流通"],"topic_mapping":["wealth","career"],"schools":["子平","盲派"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"现代职业映射到内容、产品、技术输出属于 V50 应用层解释，不能直接替代传统条件。","sources":[{"title":"Four Pillars of Destiny","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four_Pillars_of_Destiny","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"tested","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前 V50 已实现并验证，是 wealth/career 的第一条可用链。"}
{"id":"bazi.mechanism.output_controls_pressure","name_zh":"食伤制杀","domain":"bazi","category":"mechanism","summary":"用输出能力、技术或策略处理压力与规则。","definition":"食伤与官杀压力形成制化关系时，可映射为用专业能力、表达、技术或方法处理责任、竞争、风险。","conditions":["食伤与七杀/官杀同时出现","食伤能够作用于压力来源","日主或印星能承接制杀后的结构","现实压力来源可被验证"],"counter_conditions":["食伤弱而杀重不宜说能制","官杀混杂时需先区分压力性质","无印承接时可能变成冲突而非能力"],"related_concepts":["伤官见官","杀印相生","官杀混杂"],"topic_mapping":["career","risk","competition"],"schools":["子平","盲派"],"consensus_level":"medium","controversy":"制杀是否成立依赖力量、印星、月令，不能只看十神同现。","sources":[{"title":"Four Pillars of Destiny","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four_Pillars_of_Destiny","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"tested","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前 V50 已有 output_controls_pressure，但仍需和伤官见官、官杀混杂拆开。"}
{"id":"bazi.mechanism.peer_competes_for_wealth","name_zh":"比劫夺财","domain":"bazi","category":"mechanism","summary":"同类竞争、分利、合作边界影响财富承接。","definition":"比劫与财形成竞争关系时，财富结果容易受同辈、合伙、团队、分成和资源边界影响。","conditions":["比劫与财星同时出现","财星为关键主题","合作或竞争现实线索存在","财弱或边界不清时更明显"],"counter_conditions":["比劫为助力且财有规模时可变成协作扩张","有官杀约束或规则明确时夺财风险下降"],"related_concepts":["身旺财弱","合作边界","财星入库"],"topic_mapping":["wealth","cooperation","competition"],"schools":["子平","盲派"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"比劫不一定全为凶，现代组织场景中需区分合作与夺财。","sources":[{"title":"Four Pillars of Destiny","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four_Pillars_of_Destiny","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"tested","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前 V50 已实现并验证。"}
{"id":"bazi.mechanism.shangguan_jian_guan","name_zh":"伤官见官","domain":"bazi","category":"mechanism","summary":"输出/反规则力量与官星秩序发生冲突。","definition":"伤官与正官相见，常用于观察规则、职位、名誉、责任、制度压力与表达冲突。","conditions":["伤官与正官同时出现","正官为事业/关系/身份关键","伤官力量足以冲击官星","无印化伤或财通关时冲突较明显"],"counter_conditions":["有印星化伤时冲突可转为学习和规范化","有财通关时可转成商业化路径","正官弱或非关键主题时不宜过度断"],"related_concepts":["食伤制杀","官杀混杂","印星化伤"],"topic_mapping":["career","relationship","risk"],"schools":["子平","格局派"],"consensus_level":"medium","controversy":"伤官见官在古籍中多偏风险，但现代职业可表现为创新与制度摩擦，需结合结构和现实。","sources":[{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"滴天髓","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/滴天髓","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"partial","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前 output_controls_pressure 不能替代专门的伤官见官。"}
{"id":"bazi.mechanism.guan_sha_mixed","name_zh":"官杀混杂","domain":"bazi","category":"mechanism","summary":"正官与七杀并见，规则压力来源复杂。","definition":"官杀混杂用于观察权责、压力、身份规则、竞争和关系中的复杂约束，需要分清清浊、去留、制化。","conditions":["正官与七杀同时出现","官杀都参与主轴或月令/透干","缺少清理、制化或取用机制"],"counter_conditions":["去官留杀或去杀留官时混杂下降","食伤制杀、杀印相生等路径明确时可转化","弱官弱杀不宜过度断"],"related_concepts":["食伤制杀","杀印相生","伤官见官"],"topic_mapping":["career","relationship","risk"],"schools":["子平","格局派"],"consensus_level":"medium","controversy":"混杂是否为忌需结合格局和清浊，不应机械判断。","sources":[{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"滴天髓","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/滴天髓","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"missing","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"career 压力判断需要优先补。"}
{"id":"bazi.mechanism.sha_yin_xiang_sheng","name_zh":"杀印相生","domain":"bazi","category":"mechanism","summary":"压力通过学习、资质、体系承接成能力与身份。","definition":"七杀代表压力、挑战、竞争，印代表吸收、学习、资质、保护；杀印相生可表示在压力中形成专业化、资格化、组织化能力。","conditions":["七杀与印星形成连续关系","印能承接杀而不被破坏","日主能承受印生","主题落在事业、学习、管理或风险"],"counter_conditions":["杀重印弱则压力难化","印过重可能保守迟滞","食伤强冲印时需另看"],"related_concepts":["食伤制杀","官杀混杂","印旺身强"],"topic_mapping":["career","study","authority"],"schools":["子平","格局派"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"现代映射到证书、平台、专业门槛时需 Twin 验证。","sources":[{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"滴天髓","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/滴天髓","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"missing","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"career 专题必须补。"}
{"id":"bazi.mechanism.cai_guan_xiang_sheng","name_zh":"财官相生","domain":"bazi","category":"mechanism","summary":"资源、收益、组织身份和责任形成连续承接。","definition":"财能生官，常用于观察资源进入规则、职位、责任、身份或组织路径的机制。","conditions":["财星与官星同时出现并有流通","财有源或承接","官星可用且不混杂过重","主题落在事业、财富、身份"],"counter_conditions":["财弱无源则难生官","官杀混杂需先清理","身弱难任财官时需谨慎"],"related_concepts":["身弱财旺","官杀混杂","财星入库"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","status"],"schools":["子平","格局派"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"财官相生是结构机制，不等于必然升职或发财。","sources":[{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"滴天髓","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/滴天髓","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"missing","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"wealth/career 交叉映射必须补。"}
{"id":"bazi.mechanism.weak_body_strong_wealth","name_zh":"身弱财旺","domain":"bazi","category":"mechanism","summary":"资源机会大，但承载力与执行稳定性可能不足。","definition":"日主弱而财星强，常表示外部资源、欲望、责任或财富压力大于自身承接能力，需要看印比帮身或运势介入。","conditions":["日主力量弱","财星明显偏强","缺少印比支持","财富或资源成为主题"],"counter_conditions":["大运印比扶身时可承接","财星有制化或组织路径时压力下降","财旺不等于财富一定多"],"related_concepts":["身旺财弱","比劫夺财","财官相生"],"topic_mapping":["wealth","career","risk"],"schools":["子平","扶抑派"],"consensus_level":"medium","controversy":"旺衰派高度重视，格局/盲派可能降低其中心地位。","sources":[{"title":"Four Pillars of Destiny","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four_Pillars_of_Destiny","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"missing","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"需要先补精细旺衰。"}
{"id":"bazi.mechanism.strong_body_weak_wealth","name_zh":"身旺财弱","domain":"bazi","category":"mechanism","summary":"主观能量强，但财富承接点不足。","definition":"日主或比劫旺而财星弱，常用于观察能力/意志/竞争强而资源、客户、交易承接不足。","conditions":["日主强或同类多","财星弱、藏、无根或受夺","财富为主题"],"counter_conditions":["食伤生财可补财源","大运流年见财可打开承接","官杀约束比劫时竞争下降"],"related_concepts":["食伤生财","比劫夺财","大运介入"],"topic_mapping":["wealth","career"],"schools":["子平","扶抑派","盲派"],"consensus_level":"medium","controversy":"身旺财弱在现代不应直接翻译为贫穷，而应映射为承接路径问题。","sources":[{"title":"Four Pillars of Destiny","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four_Pillars_of_Destiny","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"missing","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"需要和比劫夺财、食伤生财联合判断。"}
{"id":"bazi.model.tiao_hou","name_zh":"调候","domain":"bazi","category":"model","summary":"寒暖燥湿与季节气候对结构可用性的影响。","definition":"调候关注命局气候是否过寒、过热、过燥、过湿，以及是否需要火、水、木等调节气候。","conditions":["月令季节偏寒热燥湿明显","结构有可用五行但气候不配合","健康、性情、阶段舒展度相关主题"],"counter_conditions":["不能单独以调候覆盖所有格局判断","调候用神与扶抑用神可能不同，需要 DecisionPolicy 处理冲突"],"related_concepts":["体用","旺衰","五行气候"],"topic_mapping":["health","career","portrait"],"schools":["子平","调候派"],"consensus_level":"medium","controversy":"调候与格局/扶抑的优先级存在长期争议。","sources":[{"title":"滴天髓","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/滴天髓","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"missing","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"对画像和健康很重要，但第一版可先输出为结构模型，不直接断命。"}
{"id":"bazi.model.ti_yong","name_zh":"体用","domain":"bazi","category":"model","summary":"区分主体结构与功能用途，避免只数五行。","definition":"体用用于区分命局主体、目标、作用路径与可用力量，是从素材走向判断的重要中间模型。","conditions":["需要判断结构主轴","多个机制并存","用神、调候、格局有冲突"],"counter_conditions":["体用不是单一固定算法，需模型版本化","缺少流派标注时不应直接进入用户输出"],"related_concepts":["调候","做功流通","主线条"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","portrait"],"schools":["子平","盲派","格局派"],"consensus_level":"low","controversy":"体用定义在不同体系差异大，需要保留流派分歧。","sources":[{"title":"滴天髓","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/滴天髓","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"渊海子平","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/淵海子平","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"missing","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"先作为 Research/Canon，不宜马上写死 Runtime。"}
{"id":"bazi.model.flow_mainline","name_zh":"做功流通 / 主线条","domain":"bazi","category":"model","summary":"观察力量如何从一个十神流向另一个十神并映射现实。","definition":"做功强调结构中的力量是否形成可执行路径，例如比劫到食伤到财、杀到印到身。主线条用于判断人生主题和现实表达。","conditions":["至少存在两个以上可连接的十神节点","力量有生克制化或组合关系","主题与现实反馈可验证"],"counter_conditions":["只有静态同现不能等于做功","节点被冲破或无承接时应降权","LLM 不得自行创造流通路径"],"related_concepts":["食伤生财","杀印相生","财官相生"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","theme"],"schools":["盲派","子平"],"consensus_level":"medium","controversy":"做功体系在现代课程和流派中表述差异较大，需要抽象成 V50 自有模型。","sources":[{"title":"Four Pillars of Destiny","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four_Pillars_of_Destiny","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"三命通会","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三命通會","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"},{"title":"滴天髓","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/滴天髓","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"partial","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前 V50 三条 flow 是做功模型雏形。"}
{"id":"ziwei.foundation.twelve_palaces","name_zh":"十二宫","domain":"ziwei","category":"foundation","summary":"紫微斗数以十二宫承载人生主题领域。","definition":"十二宫包括命、兄弟、夫妻、子女、财帛、疾厄、迁移、交友/仆役、官禄、田宅、福德、父母等领域，是紫微素材的基本容器。","conditions":["出生资料生成命宫身宫后排定十二宫","每宫星曜、四化、三方四正共同形成素材","主题判断必须回到对应宫位"],"counter_conditions":["宫位本身不是判断，必须结合星曜、四化、限年与三方四正","不要把十二宫直接生成用户报告"],"related_concepts":["命身宫","官禄宫","财帛宫","夫妻宫"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","relationship","health","family"],"schools":["紫微斗数"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"宫名和某些宫位称谓在不同资料中有细微差异。","sources":[{"title":"Zi Wei Dou Shu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zi_wei_dou_shu","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/紫微斗数","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数全书","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/紫微斗數全書","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"tested","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前 V50 已能从 BirthInput 生成宫位素材。"}
{"id":"ziwei.foundation.major_stars_14","name_zh":"十四主星","domain":"ziwei","category":"foundation","summary":"十四主星是紫微宫位解释的主要星曜素材。","definition":"紫微、天机、太阳、武曲、天同、廉贞、天府、太阴、贪狼、巨门、天相、天梁、七杀、破军等主星构成宫位的主要象义。","conditions":["星曜落宫明确","星曜庙旺陷或组合关系可计算","主题宫或三方四正涉及主星"],"counter_conditions":["主星不能脱离宫位、四化、限年单独断","星曜象义存在流派差异"],"related_concepts":["辅星","煞曜","四化","三方四正"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","relationship","portrait"],"schools":["紫微斗数"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"星曜性质和组合解释在门派中存在细节差异。","sources":[{"title":"Zi Wei Dou Shu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zi_wei_dou_shu","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/紫微斗数","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数全书","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/紫微斗數全書","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"implemented","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前 V50 有主星列表与排布基线，但组合语义还未完整接入。"}
{"id":"ziwei.foundation.four_transformations","name_zh":"四化","domain":"ziwei","category":"foundation","summary":"化禄、化权、化科、化忌提供动态触发与性质变化。","definition":"四化根据天干使星曜发生禄、权、科、忌变化，用于观察资源、权力、名誉、阻滞等动态信号。","conditions":["年干、宫干或流年干触发四化","四化落入主题宫或三方四正","大限/流年叠加时增强动态证据"],"counter_conditions":["化忌不等于必凶，需看宫位、星曜、主题和现实","化禄不等于必得财"],"related_concepts":["流年触发","大限主题","官禄宫","财帛宫"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","relationship","risk","timing"],"schools":["紫微斗数"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"生年四化、飞化、自化等系统差异较大，V50 第一版先采用基础四化。","sources":[{"title":"Zi Wei Dou Shu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zi_wei_dou_shu","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/紫微斗数","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数全书","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/紫微斗數全書","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"tested","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前 V50 已有基础四化和 Hua Ji pressure。"}
{"id":"ziwei.foundation.san_fang_si_zheng","name_zh":"三方四正","domain":"ziwei","category":"foundation","summary":"主题宫不能孤立看，要结合三方四正。","definition":"三方四正用于把本宫、对宫及三合方位共同纳入观察，形成主题领域的关联网络。","conditions":["主题宫有主星/四化/煞曜","对宫或三方宫位有重要星曜或四化","多宫共同指向同一主题"],"counter_conditions":["三方四正不能直接替代本宫","过度扩散会导致证据不清，需要 evidence_refs"],"related_concepts":["十二宫","对宫","四化","主题宫"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","relationship","health"],"schools":["紫微斗数"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"不同派别对三方四正权重和飞化关系不同。","sources":[{"title":"Zi Wei Dou Shu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zi_wei_dou_shu","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/紫微斗数","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数全书","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/紫微斗數全書","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"implemented","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前 V50 有关系素材，但还缺深入 topic 评分。"}
{"id":"ziwei.timing.major_annual_cycle","name_zh":"大限 / 流年","domain":"ziwei","category":"timing","summary":"紫微更适合作为阶段和年度动态证据引擎。","definition":"大限表示阶段主题，流年表示年度触发；它们与宫位、星曜、四化结合，提供 timing evidence。","conditions":["当前年龄落入某一大限","流年宫位或四化触发主题宫","大限主题与原局宫位呼应"],"counter_conditions":["流年不应脱离原局命盘","年度触发不是最终断命，必须由 Brain 决策"],"related_concepts":["四化","官禄宫","财帛宫","三方四正"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","relationship","health","timing"],"schools":["紫微斗数"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"大限起法、飞化与流年系统存在派别差异。","sources":[{"title":"Zi Wei Dou Shu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zi_wei_dou_shu","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/紫微斗数","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数全书","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/紫微斗數全書","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"partial","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前已有大限/流年素材与 timing activation，但缺更完整权重。"}
{"id":"ziwei.topic.career_official_palace","name_zh":"官禄宫事业","domain":"ziwei","category":"topic_mapping","summary":"官禄宫是紫微事业主题的重要宫位。","definition":"官禄宫用于观察事业、职业角色、工作方式、组织关系与社会责任，并需要结合三方四正和大限流年。","conditions":["官禄宫星曜或四化明显","三方四正支持事业主题","大限/流年触发官禄宫或相关宫位"],"counter_conditions":["不能仅凭官禄宫一宫断职业","财帛、迁移、福德等宫位也可能修正事业判断"],"related_concepts":["财帛宫","迁移宫","大限流年","四化"],"topic_mapping":["career"],"schools":["紫微斗数"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"职业类型映射到现代行业需要谨慎，必须经 Brain 和 Twin 验证。","sources":[{"title":"Zi Wei Dou Shu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zi_wei_dou_shu","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/紫微斗数","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数全书","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/紫微斗數全書","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"tested","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前已有 career_timing_activation。"}
{"id":"ziwei.topic.wealth_property_palace","name_zh":"财帛宫财富","domain":"ziwei","category":"topic_mapping","summary":"财帛宫是财富流动、收入方式和资源状态的重要宫位。","definition":"财帛宫观察财富模式、资源流动、收入状态，但需结合官禄、田宅、福德、迁移等宫位判断。","conditions":["财帛宫有主星、四化或煞曜激活","大限/流年触发财帛宫","八字财富机制提供长期结构"],"counter_conditions":["财帛宫强不等于必发财","化忌不等于绝对破财","必须结合八字和现实反馈"],"related_concepts":["官禄宫","田宅宫","四化","八字食伤生财"],"topic_mapping":["wealth"],"schools":["紫微斗数"],"consensus_level":"high","controversy":"不同派别对财帛宫与田宅、福德的财富权重有差异。","sources":[{"title":"Zi Wei Dou Shu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zi_wei_dou_shu","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/紫微斗数","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数全书","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/紫微斗數全書","source_type":"classic","reliability":"high"}],"runtime_status":"tested","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前已有 wealth_timing_activation。"}
{"id":"fusion.bazi_structure_ziwei_timing","name_zh":"八字长期结构 vs 紫微阶段压力","domain":"fusion","category":"cross_engine","summary":"八字偏长期结构，紫微偏阶段触发，Brain 负责裁决。","definition":"当八字显示长期机制成立，而紫微显示短期宫位压力时，不应简单冲突抵消，而应输出长期可行、短期谨慎或触发 Probe。","conditions":["Bazi candidate 与 Ziwei evidence 指向同一 topic","Ziwei 四化/大限/流年提示短期压力","Twin 现实反馈可验证阶段状态"],"counter_conditions":["紫微只提供素材，不生成第二份报告","八字不能硬覆盖短期动态","缺少 evidence_refs 时不输出"],"related_concepts":["DecisionPolicy","Expert Orchestration","Probe"],"topic_mapping":["career","wealth","timing"],"schools":["DeepBeing Fusion"],"consensus_level":"medium","controversy":"这是 V50 产品化融合原则，不是传统单一流派规则。","sources":[{"title":"Four Pillars of Destiny","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four_Pillars_of_Destiny","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"Zi Wei Dou Shu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zi_wei_dou_shu","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"},{"title":"紫微斗数","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/紫微斗数","source_type":"encyclopedia","reliability":"medium"}],"runtime_status":"tested","recommended_runtime_priority":"P0","notes":"当前 DecisionPolicy 已有初版。"}
